---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page
  path="/networking/"
  title="Networking | kiln-vm"
  description="Each kiln-vm guest gets a private address with outbound NAT. The isolated-web policy limits it to public web ports, and forward tunnels a port to your machine."
>
  <Fragment slot="open">
    <div class="say open">
      <div class="say__lead">
        <h1 class="say__title">Networking</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="say__text">
        Each VM gets a private address of its own and keeps it across stops and starts. Outbound IPv4 leaves through
        NAT on the host. kiln-vm publishes none of the guest's ports.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="ground">
    <div class="wall" aria-hidden="true">
      <p class="form form--cut ports">80 443</p>
      <div class="tunnel">
        <span class="tunnel__slot"></span>
        <span class="form tunnel__port">3000</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="notes">
      <section class="note">
        <h2 class="note__title">isolated-web</h2>
        <pre class="cmd">kiln-vm create web \
  --network-policy isolated-web</pre>
        <p>
          Under this policy a guest reaches public IPv4 addresses on TCP ports 80 and 443, and DNS on its own gateway.
          Other ports, private addresses, the host's services and all IPv6 are dropped.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="note note--end">
        <h2 class="note__title">Forward</h2>
        <pre class="cmd">kiln-vm forward dev 3000</pre>
        <p>
          <code>forward</code> listens on a free loopback port on your machine and carries each connection through the
          daemon to an agent in the guest. It opens no port on the VM, so it works under isolated-web too.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</Page>

<style>
  .open {
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .wall {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4.2cqw, 5rem);
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6cqw, 7rem);
  }

  .ports {
    --fit: 4.764;
    --bearing: 0.063em;
  }

  .tunnel {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin: -0.14em 0 -0.24em calc(-1 * var(--gutter));
    padding: 0.14em 0 0.24em;
    font-size: calc(100cqw * 0.3437 / 3.531);
    filter: url(#cut);
  }

  .tunnel__slot,
  .tunnel__port {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(10 24 56 / 0.08) 0 1px, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.6) 1px 3px, transparent 3px),
      linear-gradient(#edf0f5, #edf0f5);
    background-size:
      10px 100%,
      auto;
  }

  .tunnel__slot {
    flex: 1;
    height: 0.076em;
    margin: 0 -0.48em 0.352em 0;
  }

  .tunnel__port {
    --bearing: 0.063em;
    margin-left: 0;
    font-size: 1em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .tunnel {
      font-size: calc(100cqw * 0.56 / 3.531);
    }
  }
</style>
